      "body": {
        "type": "column",
        "scroll": true,
        "crossAxis": "stretch",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "caption",
            "value": "The shape of the work, apart from the day-to-day log. Goals are the end states a project drives at; milestones are the checkpoints on the way; decisions are the choices — settled, still open, or ones that only surfaced mid-flight. Tap any card to open it."
          },
